OL,5,G0200 Poetry Extra - Poetry Please:
OL,6,G     Goblin Market
OL,7,     FAs part of our All Request
OL,8,     FWeekend, listeners suggest Poetry
OL,9,     FPlease: Goblin Market from the
OL,10,     FBBC's poetry archive. From 2014.
OL,11,G0230 The Impressionists - From 3/3/1983
OL,12,     FRay Alan presents the voices of
OL,13,     Fstar impressionists: Peter
OL,14,     FGoodwright, Johnny More, Brian
OL,15,     FCoshall and Dave Evans. From 1983.
OL,16,G0300 A Kestrel for a Knave by Barry
OL,17,G     Hines
OL,18,     F4 Extra Debut. In a raw, mean
OL,19,     Ftown, a boy turns to the one thing
OL,20,     Fhe can trust. A kestrel. Her name
OL,21,     Fis Kes. Stars David Brierley.
